// SetterTestSupport.h): the method, the offset and the front edge of the tab (getTabOffsetMethod,
// getTabOffset, getTabFrontEdge) after the elements of a row, and the warnings. Most rows give
// the fin set a tab of 0.02 m by 0.01 m first; its root chord is 0.05 m.

